RBn = `Search for threads using a query DSL.

Query syntax:
- Keywords: Bare words or quoted phrases matched against thread titles and message text: auth or "race condition"
- Thread ID filter: id:T-... to find one exact thread
- Parent filter: parent:T-... to find a thread's direct children
- Repo filter: repo:url to scope to a repository: repo:github.com/owner/repo
- Pinned filter: pinned:true for pinned threads or pinned:false for unpinned threads
- Commit filter: commit:true/false for presence or commit:<SHA> for a SHA prefix
- Pull request filter: pr:true/false for presence or pr:<number> for a pull request number
- Author filter: author:me for your own threads or author:name for another user's
- Date filters: after:7d and before:2w filter by the last update time; updated_before:7d finds threads with no activity in the last week
- Archive filter: archived:true/false to narrow by archive status
- Combine filters: Use implicit AND: auth repo:amp after:7d

All matching is case-insensitive. Results are ordered by most recent update.`,
